# Testing

- Initial stack: **Vitest** (unit/domain) + **Playwright** (E2E). See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/ROADMAP.md`.
- Priority domain tests: habit status/min-target rules; finance classifiers (PnL ≠ deposit); Zod schemas; sensitive-flag defaults.
- Playwright starts with auth smoke and core habit/project journeys once the app boots.
- Do not claim tests passed unless the command was actually run successfully.
- DB/RLS tests run only when an approved database target is available — never spin Docker without L3 approval.
- MCP permission/audit tests belong with the MCP package when Phase 4 starts.
